# RD-14142 — the deploy button reads THIS FILE to decide which secrets to
# prompt for. Not a `secrets` key in wrangler.jsonc: that key belongs to an
# experimental wrangler feature and the button ignores it, so declaring them
# there produced a deploy with no prompts at all (observed 2026-09-02).
#
# Values here are PLACEHOLDERS shown as examples — never real secrets. The
# customer types their own into Cloudflare's setup page, which is what keeps
# them out of Rordi entirely.
#
# RORDI_WORKSPACE is deliberately a SECRET rather than a `var`: Workers Builds
# re-applies the `vars` block from wrangler.jsonc on every automatic rebuild,
# which resets it. Secrets survive. Both measured.

RORDI_WORKSPACE=ws_example
RORDI_PAIRING_CODE=pc_example
RORDI_BRIDGE_KEY=bk_example
